  "prefLabel": "Lab 502.16 Vocational rehabilitation provider",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 502.16 \"Vocational rehabilitation provider\" means any person who provides vocational rehabilitation services, such as job placement, job analysis, aptitude testing, labor market surveys and vocational counseling.\n\nSource. #11067, eff 4-1-16 (from Lab 502.13)",
